        <a href="/countries/new-zealand/income-tax/income-tax-calculator/" class="text-link hover:underline font-medium">NZ Income Tax Calculator</a>
        <a href="/countries/new-zealand/gst/gst-calculator/" class="text-link hover:underline font-medium">NZ GST Calculator</a>
        <a href="/blogs/new-zealand-income-tax-rates-brackets-2025-2026/" class="text-link hover:underline font-medium">NZ Tax Rates & Brackets Guide</a>
        <a href="/blogs/is-new-zealand-tax-free-haven-worldwide-tax-explained/" class="text-link hover:underline font-medium">Is NZ a Tax Haven? Guide</a>
